localizedName: "Delta"
description: "[accent][SIGNAL INCOMING][]
[Incoming message from superintendent TARTAR-us]
  
[red][ENEMY BASE DETECTED][]
  
A study facility has been detected on a watery, remote sector.

Most of our tech has been disabled, so you must use [accent]naval units[] to attack the base.

Long range turrets have been detected. Try using walls and units to distract them while you launch a surprise attack.

Uranium is quite scarce here, just like available space is.

[accent]This sector is optional and not required to beat the main campaign and finish the story!"
